ask member(who)

TRUE, 2 answers:

  Answer 1:
    who = "Jo"

    Because member("Jo") is satisfied by:
      member(x) if age(x, a) AND a >= 18 AND NOT banned(x)

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Jo"
      a = 30

    Proof:
      age("Jo", 30) is a fact.
      30 >= 18 is true.
      NOT banned("Jo"): banned("Jo") can't be proved.

  Answer 2:
    who = "Ana"

    Because member("Ana") is satisfied by:
      member(x) if age(x, a) AND a >= 18 AND NOT banned(x)

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Ana"
      a = 22

    Proof:
      age("Ana", 22) is a fact.
      22 >= 18 is true.
      NOT banned("Ana"): banned("Ana") can't be proved.

ask member("Bob")

FALSE, because:

  Tried:
    member(x) if age(x, a) AND a >= 18 AND NOT banned(x)

  First goal:
    age("Bob", a)

    Matched:
      a = 45

  Second goal:
    45 >= 18

    True.

  Third goal:
    NOT banned("Bob")

    FAILED:
      banned("Bob") can be proved.

ask can_bring("Ana", who)

TRUE:
  who = "Jo"

  Because can_bring("Ana", "Jo") is satisfied by:
    can_bring(x, guest) if friend(x, guest) AND member(guest) AND x != guest

  Variable bindings:
    x = "Ana"
    guest = "Jo"

  Proof:
    friend("Ana", "Jo") is a fact.

    member("Jo") is satisfied by:
      member(x) if age(x, a) AND a >= 18 AND NOT banned(x)

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Jo"
      a = 30

    Proof:
      age("Jo", 30) is a fact.
      30 >= 18 is true.
      NOT banned("Jo"): banned("Jo") can't be proved.

    "Ana" != "Jo" is true.

ask junior(who)

TRUE:
  who = "Sam"

  Because junior("Sam") is satisfied by:
    junior("Sam") if age("Sam", a) AND a < 18

  Variable bindings:
    a = 17

  Proof:
    age("Sam", 17) is a fact.
    17 < 18 is true.

